== How can py2exe help shipping emedded Python projects ==

An embedded Python project relies on several modules. Finding this modules is very easy using py2exe.

Create a ''setup.py'' script in the following format:
{{{ 
from distutils.core import setup
import py2exe

setup()
}}}

And then run it with your script in the command line
{{{
wpython setup.py py2exe --includes mymodule
}}}

This will create a ''dist'' directory with all the files you're embedded python needs.
Rename ''library.zip'' to ''python23.zip'' and place all the files in the application directory.
